t":"Пакет на критическом пути — красный стикер: его отклонение сдвигает весь проект и съедает буфер (резерв времени) перед защитой.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true,"customData":{"zone":4}},{"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"seed":122644187,"version":1,"versionNonce":724382862,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":true,"id":"z9_t195","type":"text","x":30,"y":2005,"width":1229.7600000000002,"height":22.5,"text":"Держим план — если отклонение помещается в запас или буфер. Меняем — если нет: урезаем содержание или отдаём часть работы.","originalText":"Держим план — если отклонение помещается в запас или буфер. Меняем — если нет: урезаем содержание или отдаём часть работы.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true,"customData":{"zone":4}},{"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"seed":918535983,"version":1,"versionNonce":182919560,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":true,"id":"z9_t196","type":"text","x":30,"y":2040,"width":554.4000000000001,"height":22.5,"text":"Любое изменение — в WBS, на диаграмму Ганта и в журнал.","originalText":"Любое изменение — в WBS, на диаграмму Ганта и в журнал.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true,"customData":{"zone":4}},{"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#adb5bd","backgroundColor":"#f8f9fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"seed":582644857,"version":1,"ve